\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Oben: Besitzvermerk \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Colleg. Paris. Soc. Jesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , datiert 1573 (zu ihm und zu weiteren Notizen auf f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  siehe auch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  und f.\~499\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ? \u914 ?\u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 M\u225 \'e1xim\u232 \'e8 Theol\u243 \'f3gicus et Leg\u226 \'e2lis Liber:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Livre fort Theologal et Legal.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Theol\u243 \'f3gicus et can\u243 \'f3nicus hic Liber. \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 : Innomin\u225 \'e1ti cui\u250 \'fasdam Electi\u244 \'f4num seu Annotati\u244 \'f4num divin\u226 \'e2rum, simul et Leg\u225 \'e1lium opus, in decem Libros, et titulos multos distrib\u251 \'fbtum, cum e\u244 \'f4rum \u243 \'f3mnium, quae proponuntur, Interpretati\u244 \'f4ne:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8183 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  X\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? / \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :/ 1573\u176 \'b0/. \emdash  Senkrecht: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Theologie et droict Canon\u903 ?/.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  Angabe der Anzahl der beschriebenen Folien (Haupttext) wohl von Claude Naulot: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 495\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

