\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Vorsatz: Leer. \emdash  (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk mit Inhaltsangabe {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , datiert 1573, vgl. auch ff.\~2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 399\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 403\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ?) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Liber legalis simul et Regius. Livre d\rquote affaires legales et R\u246 \'f6yales.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u968 \'f8\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Coll\u233 \'e9ctio et observ\u225 \'e1tio Legalum, simul et Regalium praescripti\u244 \'f4num, et haec omnia per elementorum ordinem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7964 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u205 \'cdnsuper adfinem, coll\u233 \'e9ctio ex Nou\u233 \'e9llis pii Regis Le\u244 \'f4nis.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? / \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :/ 1573/ \emdash  Neuzeitlicher Tintenvermerk der Anzahl der beschriebenen Folien: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 403\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Leer.}

