\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (f.\~399\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , datiert 1573, siehe auch f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 403\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u965 \'f5\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7989 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948