 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff.\~400\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 401\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. XXVIII.13, 15\endash 20, 27\endash 29, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1870 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 251\endash 252, 254: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 >\u8009 ?< \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff.\~401\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 403\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tit. IV.54\endash 55, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1870, S. 35\endash 37: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 >\u7977 ?<\u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Textende als Kreuz gestaltet mit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u921 \'c9\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  | \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u935 \'d7\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  | \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  | \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  in den Kreuzarmen siehe auch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Il\plain \f1\lang1033\