\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi-420\li420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Kat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  [F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ment\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \endash  L.\~G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Oudart-Feudrix\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Br\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 quigny\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ], Catalogus manuscriptorum codicum Collegii Claromontani, Paris 1764, S. 61 (CXCII). \emdash  J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meerman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bibliotheca Meermanniana; sive Catalogus ..., IV, Den Haag 1824, S. 25 (170). \emdash \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Omont\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Catalogue des manuscrits grecs de Guillaume Pelicier, in: Biblioth\u232 \'e8que de l\rquote \u233 \'e9cole des Chartes 46 (1885), S. 66 (51, mit falscher Zuordnung der sp\u228 \'e4teren Signaturen). \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gardthausen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 57\endash 61. \emdash  RHBR I, S. 122\endash 123 (Nr.100).
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi-420\li420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. E. Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7985 ? \u8172 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?, oder die Schrift \u252 \'fcber die Zeitabschnitte, Heidelberg 1836\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. E. Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 von Lingenthal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ecloga Privata, Ecloga ad Prochiron Mutata et Epananagoge Aucta (Jus IV), Leipzig 1865, erw\u228 \'e4hnt auf S. 173. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. E. Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Prochiron auctum, Leipzig 1870 (Jus VI = \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zepos VII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), erw\u228 \'e4hnt auf S. CLXXXVIII. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 G. Rodolakes, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u913 \'c1\u960 \'f0\u972 \'fc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u929 \'d1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  530 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u942 \'de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u941 \'dd\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\u965 \'f5\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u973 \'fd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u943 \'df\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Athen 2007, bes. 149. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 L. Burgmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die Nomoi Stratiotikos, Georgikos und Nautikos, in: Zbornik radova Vizantoloskog instituta 46 (2009), S. 53\endash 64 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "http://www.ceeol.com"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat18\cf1 www.ceeol.com}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); bes. S. 57.}

