\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Buchbindervorsatz: Leer. \emdash  (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Oben: Neuzeitlicher Tintenvermerk der Anzahl der beschriebenen Folien: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 161. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht identifizierte Zahl \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 176\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash Besitzvermerk \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Colleg. Paris. Soc. Jesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Titel und Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk von der Hand des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , datiert 1573, vgl. auch f.\~2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ? : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Leg\u226 \'e2lis Liber : Liure aux Loix.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs16  \u8103 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \u884 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u176 \'b0. \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7941 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u924 \'cc\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Le\u244 \'f4nis Regis Variae Leges, Adhaec Metropolit\u225 \'e1nae ciuit\u225 \'e1tes Constantinopolitani Throni, et cat\u225 \'e1logus Regum, tam \u224 \'e0 Christo abhorr\u233 \'e9ntium, qu\u224 \'e0m Christian\u244 \'f4rum, vn\u224 \'e0 cum Patri\u225 \'e1rchis Constantinop\u243 \'f3leos./  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u935 \'d7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\u8166 ? / \u884 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  / 1573.\u176 \'b0/. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Siehe auch \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Leer.}

