\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1.\tab (ff.\~2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eisagoge/Epanagoge aucta}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1865 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 171\endash 370 u. a. aus Cod. gr. 43 (dort als Codex Bienerianus A bezeichnet): (f.\~2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pro\u246 \'f6mium, S. 180: >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u945 \'e1\u884 ? \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 . \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed. \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3. \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u884 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u964 \'f4\u943 \'df. \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u972 \'fc\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u973 \'fd\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\