\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , datiert 1573, vgl. auch ff. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u935 \'d7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  /\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \u7945 ?\u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Anno Christi Seruat\u244 \'f4ris/ 1573\u176 \'b0/ Hunc legens agn\u244 \'f4uit Librum, etc. Cl. Naulot du Val.
