\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Oben: Neuzeitlicher Tintenvermerk der Anzahl der beschriebenen Folien: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 133. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nicht identifizierte \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 M C 177\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Besitzvermerk \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Colleg. Paris. Soc. Jesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \emdash  Lekt\u252 \'fcrevermerk von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Claude Naulot du Val d\rquote Avallon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), datiert 1573, vgl. auch 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ? : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Leg\u226 \'e2lis Liber : Liure es Loix./\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 /. \emdash  \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Innominati cuiuspiam de Legibus opus, Adh\u230 \'e6c Andronici Callisti super Infortun\u225 \'e1ta Constantin\u243 \'f3poli N\plain \f3\i\lang1066\fs20 \u230 \'e6\u769 ?nia seu\plain \f4\i\lang1066\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lug\u251 \'fbbris oratio: \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8183 ?/ \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u935 \'d7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\u8166 ? / \u884 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  /\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Anno Christi / 1573\u17