 \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8179 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Leonis et Constantini Imperatorum eclog\u233 \'e9 seu compendium legum. Andronici Callisti monodia de misera Constantinopoli.}

