\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. E. Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u8009 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Imperatorum Basilii, Constantini et Leonis Prochiron, Heidelberg 1837, bes. S. CLXXXIX; 306. \emdash  C. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rezension von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mortreuil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Histoire III in: Kritische Jahrb\u252 \'fccher f\u252 \'fcr deutsche Rechtswissenschaft 11 (1847), S. 581\endash 638 (Ndr. im Ndr. von \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mortreuil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Osnabr\u252 \'fcck 1966), bes. S. 584. \emdash  C. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zachariae, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Ecloga Legum\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Leipzig\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  1856 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (in: Jus II; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zepos IV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), S. 268 (nur erw\u228 \'e4hnt). \emdash  N. G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Svoronos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Recherches sur la tradition juridique a Byzance. La Synopsis major des Basiliques et ses Appendices\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Biblioth\u232 \'e8que byzantine, \u201 \'c9tudes 4), Paris 1964, bes. S. 9, 27. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 F. Sitzia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De Actionibus, edizione e commento (Pubblicazioni dell'Istituto di Diritto Romano e dei Diritti dell'Oriente Mediterraneo 46), Mailand 1973, bes. S. 16, 27 (Sigle M).\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schminck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studien zu mittel\-byzan\-tinischen Rechtsb\u252 \'fcchern (Forschungen zur byzanti\-nischen Rechtsgeschichte 13), Frankfurt am Main 1986, bes.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 S. 109\endash 119, 122 Anm. 30, 134\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \emdash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 F. Sitzia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le Rhopai, Neapel 1984, bes. S. 36\endash 37. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  N. van der Wal \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B.\~H. Stolte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Collectio Tripartita, Justinian on Religious and Ecclesiastical Affairs, Groningen 1994, Edition aus Cod. gr. 46, zu diesem bes. S. XLVII\endash XLVIII, LI. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rodolakes\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u913 \'c1\u960 \'f0\u972 \'fc \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef \u929 \'d1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef 53\u176 \'b0 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed. \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u942 \'de \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u941 \'dd\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u914 \'c2\u965 \'f5\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u973 \'fd \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u943 \'df\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Athen 2007, bes. S. 149.}

