\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Collectio Tripartita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 van der Wal / Stolte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1994 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 3\endash 163, u. a. aus Cod. gr. 46 (Sigle: B); \u220 \'dcberblick \u252 \'fcber die Hss. und fr\u252 \'fcheren Editionen, ebenda S. XLII\endash LIV; zu Cod. gr. 46 bes. S. XLVII\endash XLVIII, LI: Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften und -z\u228 \'e4hlung sowie Verweise in margine von der Hand des Kopisten; Korrekturen in hellerer Tinte wohl von einer zweiten, etwas sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Auf dem oberen Rand von f. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von einer Hand des 17./18. Jh. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex Paratitlis Graecorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , daneben von einer Hand des 19. Jh. wohl Hinweis auf Bibliotheca Iuris Canonici Veteris, II, Paris 1661: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ex Theod. Balsamonis Sylloge in Justell. edit. a pag. 1238 ad princ. pag. 1253. haec octo priora folia s(un)t sumpta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (siehe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (ff.\~1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel 1: De summa trinitate et de fide catholica et ut nemo de ea publice contendere audeat, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 van der Wal/\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stolte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1994 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 12\endash 21: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc. mut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (S. 17, Z. 22) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... . \emdash  (f.\~3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Paratitla, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 van der Wal\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stolte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1994 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 21\endash 22: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8005 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7975 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7969 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? (lacuna) conpenticula ... . \emdash  (ff.\~3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel 2, ed.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  van der Wal\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stolte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1994 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): De sacrosanctis ecclesiis et de rebus et privilegiis earum, S. 23\endash 29: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sacrosantis ecclesins et de rebus et pribiligiis eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!). \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7937 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u7953 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... . \emdash  (ff.\~7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Paratitla, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 van der Wal\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stolte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1994 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 29\endash 34: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8005 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u884 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . <\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >, \u7975 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7969 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nullus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des. mut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (S. 33, Z. 24) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8058 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7988 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 .
