\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u220 \'dcberliefert sind folgende Abschnitte (Z\u228 \'e4hlung nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sitzia)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : (f.\~41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . 1\endash 3, 5\endash 12. (I.4 fehlt) \emdash  (f.\~41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u921 \'c9\u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash III; IV.1\endash 5. \emdash  (ff.\~41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. V\endash IX, X.1\endash 7 (X.5 und 7 fehlen nicht!). \emdash  (f.\~42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. XI.1\endash 9, 11, 14\endash 16; Cap. XII.1; Cap. XI.20; 21, 18; 19. \emdash  (f.\~42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. XIII; XIV.1\endash 3, 5\endash 10. \emdash  (f.\~43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. XIV.12\endash 20; Cap. XV. \emdash  Cap. XVI.1. \emdash  Cap. XVII.1, 4\endash 8; Cap. XIX.1. \emdash  (f.\~43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. XVIII.1. \emdash  (f.\~43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Cap. XIX.2\endash 5, 8\endash 17, 21; mit Zusatz nach \u167 \'a7 17, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zachariae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 169: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\chcbpat17 \u7960 ?\u8048 ?\u957 \'ed \u956 \'ec\u8052 ? \u959 \'ef\u7985 ? \u966 \'f6\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9 \u7955 ?\u958 \'ee \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3