ain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et propitius erit terre populi sui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Weitere Lesarten der lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung: (V. 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ut pluuia \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (V. 5) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ei et \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (V. 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 heccine reddis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 possedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 te fecit et creavit te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85 (V. 30) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 persequebatur \u8230 \'85 fugarent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

