\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8135 ? \u8032 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?. / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et super excelsa mea deducet me victor in psalmis canentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
