\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 8. Ode (Text nach Daniel 3, 57\endash 88, 56); Biblia Sacra, Rom 1981, S. 70\endash 73: \u8040 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Canticum trium puerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u903 ? inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 E\u8016 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5, \u960 \'f0\u940 \'dc\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ? \u7956 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1}}\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24  \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u943 \'df\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5, \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed \u954 \'ea\u973 \'fd\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u968 \'f8\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . E\u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Benedicite omnia opera domini}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino laudate et superexaltate eum in secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicite angeli domini domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicite celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (V. 65) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 spiritus dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 (V. 83) \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u968 \'f8\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benedicat \u8230 \'85 dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (V. 88)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u968 \'f8\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Benedicite Anania Azaria Misahel \u8230 \'85in secula. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Mit folgendem Zusatz:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \pla