\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 9. Ode (Lc 1, 68\endash 79: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  c): \u8040 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u884 ?\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (salmu)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 s D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (avi)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u917 \'c5\u8016 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u973 \'fd\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u8001 ? \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7992 ?\u963 \'f3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u942 \'de\u955 \'eb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u941 \'dd\u968 \'f8\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u943 \'df\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5 \u955 \'eb\u973 \'fd\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?  / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\