s24 \u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u7952 ?\u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8022 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [...] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7957 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Verk\u252 \'fcrzte Abschrift des Schreiberspruches (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

