 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \u7970 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8003 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7970 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u937 \'d9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8050 ? \u8038 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u941 \'dd\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \