\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (f. 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Bekanntmachung eines Privilegs von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hugo IV}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1294\endash 1359), K\u246 \'f6nig von Zypern und Titulark\u246 \'f6nig von Jerusalem f\u252 \'fcr {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Balduin de Nores}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1280/90\endash 1345), chevalier, mareschal de l'hostel (zu Balduin de Nores vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 E.\~G. Rey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les familles d'outre-mer de Du Cange, Paris 1869, S. 572\endash 573): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\chcbpat17 \u915 \'c3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u7956 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9 \u960 \'f0\u8118 ?\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 | \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8000 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8000 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (= Balduin de Nores) \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 |\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 | \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 | \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [\u8230 \'85] (sic). \emdash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Hugo par la grace de Die\u250 \'fa Roy de Jerusalem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  et de Chypre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 a Baudouin de Nure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 salus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 |\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Je vous mamd(e)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 veant ses let\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 re\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 ue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 vous nous . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 bone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ] \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 a N \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 a Famag\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Darunter schreibt wohl Quintus Septimius Florens Rivinus (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Hugo par la grace de Die\u250 \'fa Roy de Jerusalem et de Chypre. Ad hunc Hugonem Inclytum Hierusalem et Cypri Regem misit et dedicavit Genealogiam suam Deorum J. Boccacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (f. V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Leer. \emdash  (f. V\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Literaturangaben von der Hand des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Quintus Septimius Florens Rivinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1651\endash 1713; s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Michael Leander praefatione ad erotemata Graecae Linguae \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Basel 1565; VD16 N 379) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inter libros ineditos et adhuc latitantes ut edatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 optat Joannis Scholastici Climax sive sermones xxx. Videlicet de mortificatione animae et mentis ante mortem corporis, de sacra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 et animae quiete, de sacra et virtutum matre beata oratione \u8230 \'85 Eidem pag. 207 ibid. desideratur Gregorii Nysseni Catechetica \u8230 \'85 capitam quadam,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8103 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  (f. VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) S. u. Fragment.}

