\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx225\tx450\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (f. IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) <{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas Aquinatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa Theologica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Quaestio 14: Lateinische Fragmente in einer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5130[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 italienischen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Textualis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 1. Viertels des 15. Jh}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., vier {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5260[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pergamentstreifen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  als R\u252 \'fcckenverst\u228 \'e4rkung zwischen den B\u252 \'fcnden, jeweils ca. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5360[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 80 x 50 mm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Text beginnt auf f. IV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Sichtbar sind 13 von vermutlich 19 erhaltenen Zeilen; Schriftbreite Fr. I: 25 mm; Fr. II: 45 mm. Fr. III\endash IV nur jeweils die letzte Zeile des Textes und der untere Rand des Blattes erhalten.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx225\tx450\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Fr. I: \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (f. IV\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , zweitoberster Streifen) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 filij diffidencie, ut}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ex parte omnipotentie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 arbitrium remanet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 abicit a se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est. Unde ex parte sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 remittere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (f. I\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 videtur quod homo ad hoc peccata}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 P<reterea, peccatum in spiritum \u8230 \'85 electione. Sed hoc non statim\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 [\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 dic\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 it enim philosophus, in VI Etic\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 non tamen potest statim opera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 ri\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ] \u8230 \'85 des. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 quod peccatum in spiritum sanctum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 Fr. II: (f. IV\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , oberster Streifen) inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Nec hoc dominus dixit Iudaeis] quasi ipsi peccarent in spiritum sanctum}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 , >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 n<ondum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 immundum \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 dicentes peccatum vel blasphemiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \emdash 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (f. I\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 qui malicia dicitur}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 A\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 lio modo contingit ex eo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 spes per desperacionem, et timor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 alia huiusmodi, ut infra dicetur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  des. [\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 impe\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 diunt, sunt effectus spiritus in nobis et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

