\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb240\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Photius <Patriarcha>}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lexicon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ch. Theodoridis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Photii Patriarchae Lexicon, Berlin, New York, 1982 (keinerlei Hinweis auf Cod. gr. 28); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hermann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1808 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) u. a. aus Cod. gr. 28 (Sigle B): \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (f. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Photius <Patriarcha>, Epistula ad Thomam Protospatarium\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Theodoridis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , S. 1, 1\endash 9: \u7977 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u934 \'d6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang103