\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi-420\li420\tx420\qj\ri0\sb195\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Pr  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Die Provenienz vom Sinai zeigt ein B\u252 \'fccherfluch auf f. 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 : \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 |\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8004 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \u8004 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 (!) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 |\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ? \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0(\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 )\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \plain \f3\lang1033\fs20 |\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5. Darunter Unterschrift als Monokondylien [\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8230 \'85\~ ] [\u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ]. \emdash  vgl.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Sinai, Katharinenkloster, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Cod. gr. 408}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 auch mit \u228 \'e4hnlichem Fluch (dort unterschrieben von \u8009 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\