\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (pp. 11\endash 29) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liste der Patriarchen von Alexandria, Antiochia sowie der dem Patriarchat von Alexandria unterstehenden W\u252 \'fcrdentr\u228 \'e4ger}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (pp. 11\endash 13) Liste der Patriarchen von Alexandria vom Evangelisten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Markos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bis {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kosmas II.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1723\endash 1736) mit Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen bis {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gerasimos III.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1783\endash 1788): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (p. 14) Leer. \emdash  (pp. 15\endash 17) Liste der griechisch-orthodoxen Patriarchen von Antiochia vom {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Apostel Petros}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bis {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Silvester von Zypern}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1724\endash 1766) mit Nachtrag von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Philemon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1766\endash 1767) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Daniel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1767\endash 1791): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (pp. 18\endash 26) Leer. \emdash  (pp. 27\endash 29) Liste der dem Patriarchat von Alexandria unterstehenden Metropoliten und Bist\u252 \'fcmer, die bis zur Eroberung von \u196 \'c4gypten durch die Osmanen bestanden haben: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u957 \'ed\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u7989 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u955 \'eb\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7984 ?\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8008 ?\u952 \'e8\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

