\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (pp. 51\endash 53) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Zusammenstellung von Begriffen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (pp. 51\endash 52) Begriffe, die jeweils siebenmal vorkommen: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u8051 ?\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7953 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8049 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (pp. 52\endash 53) 12 Plagen in \u196 \'c4gypten: \u7977 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7984 ?\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \rquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7977 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8165 ?\u8049 ?\u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u969 \'f9\u971 \'fb\u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8061 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7984 ?\u947 \'e3\u8059 ?\u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7987 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8061 ?\u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7992 ?\u963 \'f3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8053 ?\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Darunter der Hinweis, dass manche die erste und letzte aufgez\u228 \'e4hlte Plage nicht mitrechnen und daher von 10 Plagen sprechen. \emdash  10 Gebote: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7961 ?\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u969 \'f9\u971 \'fb\u963 \'f3\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8051 ?\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (pp. 54\endash 58) Leer.}

