\pard\sl288\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (pp. 75\endash 76) Zum Text vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 L. Burgmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ecloga Basilicorum (Forschungen zur byzantinischen Rechtsgeschichte 15), Frankfurt am Main 1988, Titel 2.1\endash 5; die Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung deutet auf die Epanagoge oder Epanagoge Aucta (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Zepos II; Zepos VI)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u