fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . . \emdash  b. Erschaffung von K\u246 \'f6rper und Seele: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8118 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8022 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8003 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed (!)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8005 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u946 \'e2\u8060 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u8059 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8166 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u969 \'f9\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7940 ?\u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u8182 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Gen. 2, 7), \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u948 \'e4\u8050 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7968 ?[\u8230 \'85]\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8061 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u96