'e4tsbibliothek Leipzig, in: \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bravo Garcia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , The Legacy of Bernard de Montfaucon, S. 395\endash 401, 857\endash 861, bes. 397\endash 398 mit Tafel 1\endash 3. \emdash  \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 I. P\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rez Mart\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 n\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , Chronography and Geography in Tenth-Century Constantinople: the Manuscript of the \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs20 Stadiasmos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20  (Madrid, BN, Mss/4701), in: Geographia antiqua 25 (2016), S. 79\endash 97, bes. S. 81. \emdash \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20  P. Eleuteri\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 , I manoscritti dell\lquote  opera Pseudo-Aristotelica De virtute, in: Scripta 9 (2016), S. 72\endash 88, bes. S. 80. \emdash  \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 T. Dorandi,\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20  Laertiana.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 Capitoli sulla tradizione manoscritta e sulla storia del testo delle Vite dei filosofi di Diogene Larzio (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Altertumskunde 264), Berlin, New York 2009 (nur Verweis auf \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wiesner \plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 1974)..}

