\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 <Nicetas Heracleensis>}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Catena in evangelium secundum Ioannem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Breitkatene; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Reuss\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Typus E (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); CPG IV, C144. Text identisch mit dem Text des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cod. graec. Monac. 437}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (siehe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Titel von einer Hand des 17. Jh.: (f. 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 COMMENTARIUS IN CAPUT PRIMUM EVANGELII IOANNIS\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Von dieser Hand wohl auch Unterstreichungen und Verweise auf {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Balthasar Cordier}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Catena Patrum graecorum in S. Joannem, Antwerpen, 1630 und die Ausgabe der Werke des Basilius (Divi Basilii Magni Opera graeca quae ad nos extant omnia, Basel, [Froben] 1551\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VD16 B 639]); z. B. auf f. 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Desecta \u232 \'e8 Basilio homil. in principio Evangelii Ioannis, p. m. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (pagina media ?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  198. Habes et in Catena Corderii pag. 4.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prooemium, vgl. Basilius Caesariensis, Homilia in illud: In principio erat verbum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u8118 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7969 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8016 ?\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Z. 9) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7992 ?\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8054 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang10