\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De Melisso, Xenophane et Gorgia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (MXG), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I. Bekker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Aristotelis opera, Berlin 1831 (Nachdruck 1960), 974a1\endash 980b21; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 H. Diels\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: Abh. der K\u246 \'f6nig. Preuss. Akad. d. Wiss. zu Berlin, Phil.-Hist. Klasse, 1899\endash 1900, S.\~1\endash 40 (Text, S. 15\endash 40); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J. Wiesner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ps.-Aristoteles, MXG. Der historische Wert des Xenophanes-Referats. Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte des Eleatismus, Amsterdam 1974, S. 341\endash 350. \emdash  Eine sp\u228 \'e4tere westliche Hand (16. Jh. ?) verzeichnet die im Text erw\u228 \'e4hnten griechischen Philosophen und Hesiod (976b16): (ff. 299\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 974a1\endash 977a15: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u918 \'c6\u8053 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u912 \'c0\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed \u949 \'e5\u7988 ? \u964 \'f4\u943 \'df \u7952 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8001 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u943 \'df\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u964 \'f4\u8056 ? \u8005 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  (ff. 301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 977a15\endash 979a10: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u926 \'ce\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8049 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u948 \'e4\u8059 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8054 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u943 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7938 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u955 \'eb\u973 \'fd\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8035 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u941 \'dd\u967 \'f7\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 302\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 979a11\endash 980b21: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\u8016 ?\u954 \'ea \u949 \'e5\u7990 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u943 \'df \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed \u959 \'ef\u8016 ?\u948 \'e4\u941 \'dd\u957 \'ed\u183 \'b7 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (f. 303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Leer.}

