s24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7988 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...] (f. E 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc. mut.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666g/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... . Triadikon: \u7948 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?, \u7969 ? \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Theotokion: \u7948 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7969 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 . \emdash  (f. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8096 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u94