\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Interlinear-Glossen erster Hand}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Grandolini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 3\endash 69, 74, 79, 90, vgl. auch die Siglen BoNV im krit. App. (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \u220 \'dc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); einige Glossen bei Grandolini nicht ber\u252 \'fccksichtigt, vgl. z. B. V. 13 und V. 15: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (zu V. 2: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u7940 ?\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (zu V. 2: \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7988 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (zu V. 2: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ? \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (zu V. 13: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u942 \'de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7972 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed \u956 \'ec\u941 \'dd\u956 \'ec\u968 \'f8\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u958 \'ee\u943 \'df\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7972 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u972 \'fc\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 (zu V. 15: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u960 \'f0\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (V. 327) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash Das Scholion zu V. 329 in margine, in textu supr. lin. teilweise wiederholt. 
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Internlinear Glossen: (f. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Grandolini, S. 12\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 13:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (zu V. 27: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , vgl. Glosse zu V. 194) >\u7972 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u941 \'dd\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 <. \emdash (zu V. 27: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u952 \'e8\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ) >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  ?]<. \emdash  (zu V. 29: 