\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Grammatische und lexikalische Glossen von westlicher Hand: (zu V. 17: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \rquote \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  (zu V. 21: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7957 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lan