\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (f. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Ps.-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Longinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De sublimitate,}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ed. D. A.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Russell\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Longinus, On the Sublime, Oxford \u178 \'b21970. \emdash   Kollation des Cod. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Paris, BNF, Ms. gr. 2036}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Medic. Reg. 3083), als C(odex)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 R(egius) bezeichnet, die Referenzedition ist \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 T. Faber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Le Fevre), Longini De sublimitate libellus, Salmuria 1663 (Leipzig, UB, Or. gr. 33), die aktuelle Edition ist D. A.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Russell\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Longinus, On the Sublime, Oxford \u178 \'b21970; siehe die Angaben auf f. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Variae Lectiones & Not\u230 \'e6 ad Longinum de Sublimitate, quas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 earundem auctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vir Doctissimus Joannes Boivinius humanissime communicavit cum Frid. Rostgaard 1697\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sectio I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . (V.\~L.) Pag. 1. lin. 4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8050 ? / \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8050 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  C.\~R. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (f. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sectio VII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in MS. autem \plain \f3\lang1033\fs24 \u987 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u884 ? ... (f. 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sectio XL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in MS. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u952 \'e8\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 des. (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 N* amplius deliberandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pag. 100 \u8230 \'85 lin. 10 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7974 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \u8039 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post haec verba mutilus est Codex Regius, reliqua adjecta manu recentiori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et mendosa sunt. Ego plura deesse opinor. Haec autem ab aliquo assuta esse ne videretur codex mutilus, id ut credam eo adducor quod Longinus plura polliceatur, cum ait \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \rquote \~\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \rquote  \u7952 ?\u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8050 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8134 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Longinus 44, 12).}

