\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 (ff. 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Aldina {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 III}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (ff. 80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In praenotiones Hippocratis III (vgl. oben ff. 42\endash 47), Bl. 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  In praedictiones Hippocratis I, 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In aphorismos Hippocratis I, Bl. 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Hippocratis aphorismos commentarii I-VII: 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Adversus Lycum libellus, Bl. 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  Adversus Iulianum libellus, Bl. 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Hippocratis epidemiorum et Galeni in illum commentarius, I\endash VI, Bl. 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 244\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In lib. Hippocratis de fracturis liber I\endash II, Bl. 245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )In lib. Hippocratis de articulis liber I\endash IV, Bl. 269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 304\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In lib. Hippocratis de officina medici I\endash III, Bl. 305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 326\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \emdash  (ff. 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Leer.}

