\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb240\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kollation und Abschrift von Handschriften aus Neapel, Biblioteca Nazionale Vittorio Emanuele III}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Unter der erw\u228 \'e4hnten Signatur \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I.B.18\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  oder \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XVI \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 sind koptische Fragmente gesammelt, vermutlich wurden die griechischen Fragmente ausgel\u246 \'f6st und gesondert aufgestellt. Es handelt sich wohl um Cod. II C 32 (nach Pinakes: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cirillo 91bis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , dat. 14. Jh.), auf den die Beschreibung Tischendorfs passt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Aus dem Codex Barbonicus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (! = Borbonicus)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  I B 18. oder XVI. Er enth\u228 \'e4lt Exzerpte aus verschiedenen griechischen Autoren und ist etwa aus dem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 t\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jahrh., Bombyzin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (ff. 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De somniis, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  I, S. 622\endash 658. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (f. 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Flaccum, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 537. \emdash  (f. 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De decalogo, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 202. \emdash  (ff. 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De specialibus legibus I, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II, S. 264\endash 265. \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (f. 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs48\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De vita Mosis\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S. 151\endash 175. \emdash  (f. 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De specialibus legibus, quae referuntur ad duo decalogi capita sextumseptimumque praeceptum\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S. 302\endash 322. \emdash  (f. 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De praemiis et poenis\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S. 414\endash 425. \emdash  (f. 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De specialibus legibus, quae referuntur ad tria decalogi capita,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De festis diebus, ed.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  S. 270\endash 272, 281\endash 287. \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (ff. 66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs32 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De mercede meretricis, in templo non admittenda, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 267\endash 269. \emdash De ebrietate, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, I,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 361\endash 365. \emdash  De Iosepho, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, II,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  S. 42\endash 78. \emdash  De ebrietate, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I, S. 372\endash 383. \endash  De plantatione, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 I, S. 345\endash 353. \emdash  De nobilitate, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mangey, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 II, 438.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb240\sa0\itap0 (ff. 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Neapel, Biblioteca Nazionale Vittorio Emanuele III, Ms. III.A.15 (Cirillo 218)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : (ff. 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \endash 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Quod deus sit immutabilis) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u7960 ?\u954 \'ea \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u934 \'d6\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u7961 ?\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u8054 ? \u959 \'ef\u8023 ? \u949 \'e5\u7988 ?\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u7970 ? \u934 \'d6\u8055 ?\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9 \u7970 ? \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat18 \u8009 ? \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u959 \'ef\u8016 ? \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8049 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 24.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (De Abrahamo, Cap. 151\endash 153) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u