\fs24 \u968 \'f8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inc. >\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u7949 ?<\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\~. \emdash  (f. 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Urspr\u252 \'fcnglich leer, siehe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Pr.}

