Et paragraphus \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7949 ?\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7992 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u934 \'d6\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  etc. etc. ultimus \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u8021 ?\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) in Freheriana plane desunt. Paragraphus \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u8055 ?\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  uti in Freherianis non reperitur, ita tantum in praelectionibus ecclesiasticis additum fuisse mihi videtur et proinde eius supplementum in hoc codice a Nicephoro Lacedaemoniense neglectum fuit \u8230 \'85 .\emdash  (f. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 2. H\u228 \'e4lfte) Kopie der Schreiberunterschrift: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u9