\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 13}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 )}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Nr. 1 (Erg\u228 \'e4nzung), R. Foerster, Scriptores physiognomonici graeci et latini, II, Leipzig 1893, S. 225\endash 228:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  In illo codice, cuius memini qui incipit \u224 \'e0 Manuelis. epistol reperiuntur sequentia: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Leo VI sapiens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Physiognomica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs20 \u966 \'f6\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?. \emdash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Secundus Philosophus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Sententiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. E. Perry\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Secundus the silent philosopher, New York 1964, S. 78\endash 90: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u7944 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u8165 ?\u8053 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u7939 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8048 ? \u7945 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8049 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u7952 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  quid est mundus? quid est dies? quid est sol? etc. circumferuntur, ni fallor, latine sed absque nomine Secund.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Severianus Gabalensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\u949 \'e5\u946 \'e2\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8057 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u7936 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8061 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs20 \emdash  Gregorius Thaumaturgus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Confessio fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 CPG 1764}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 BHG 715d}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Expositio fidei quam Johannes apostolus & theologus in visione communicavit S. Gregorio \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u920 \'c8\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8179 ? \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (!).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \emdash  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u923 \'cb\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \u8000 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8134 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8053 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8182 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  \u7960 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8061 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8166 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f2\lang1033\fs20 .}

