n \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8179 ?. Paschalium s. primum incipit \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7956 ?\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u885 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7936 ?\u966 \'f6\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  1545 quo anno liber impressus)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \emdash  (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Z. 29\endash 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , Z. 2) Angaben zur Edition 1545, siehe dort, Bl. aaaIII: \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 Titulus libri \u932 \'d4\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7936 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u952 \'e8\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed \u7993 ?\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3o\u955 \'eb\u8059 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u923 \'cb\u945 \'e1\u8059 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u8001 ?\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ? \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u8057 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2 \u7969 ?\u956 \'ec\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed \u931 \'d3\u8049 ?\u946 \'e2\u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1 \u8230 \'85 \u7956 ?\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7952 ?\u954 \'ea\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . [stans] hic liber praefationem \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u7944 ?\u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u8055 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u925 \'cd\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u954 \'ea\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u922 \'ca\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \emdash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (f.\~15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Beispiel f\u252 \'fcr die Jahresberechnung, basierend auf dem Kolophon der Edition:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Annum Christi \u885 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  s. 1545 coincidit cum anno ab orbe condita \u885 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u947 \'e3\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  s. 7053 secundum computum Graecorum. Ergo annum ab orb. cond. \u885 ?\plain \f4\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u987 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  s. 6608, quo scriptus est Codex membranaceus coincidit cum anno Christi \u885 ?\plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs24\cf1 \u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u884 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  s. 1100.}

