lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... . \emdash  Dienstag, TR, S. 261, 264: >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8147 ?<, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7974 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7997 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8055 ? \u8165 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8230 \'85 . >\u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u7974 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8009 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u969 \