\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\qj\ri0\sb120\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (ff.\~198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) 4. Woche,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 31\endash 35; Angabe der Wochentage in margine von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: Montag, TR 365; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 31: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u8115 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7953 ?\u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7974 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u924 \'cc\u8051 ?\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u8166 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u958 \'ee\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... . \emdash  Dienstag, TR 372; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 32: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u8131 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7974 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u925 \'cd\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... . \emdash  Mittwoch, TR 380\endash 381; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 33: >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7974 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u8011 ?\u957 \'ed \u960 \'f0\u8049 ?\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9 \u924 \'cc\u969 \'f9\u971 \'fb\u963 \'f3\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u960 \'f0\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2 \u8230 \'85 . \emdash  Donnerstag, TR 395; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 34: >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7974 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8059 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20  \u931 \'d3\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ? \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u962 \'f2 ... . TR 403; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tillyard \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Nr. 35: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u946 \'e2\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (!), >\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8135 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7953 ?\u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7974 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u884 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u932 \'d4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u7941 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... . }

