\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx225\tx450\qj\ri0\sb120\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (f. 249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Argumenta und metrische \u220 \'dcberschrift (?) von Hand IIIA, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bachmann 1835 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , S. 665; Bekker 1827 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , S. 752 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (Hyp. 1\endash 2 [Arg. 1]); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Van Thiel, S. 453: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Arg. 1: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7944 ?\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u8058 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8052 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u8016 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Arg. 2: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8050 ?\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u8049 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7956 ?\u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u8052 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7965 ?\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Titel von Hand IA (?): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7992 ?\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8009 ?\u956 \'ec\u8053 ?\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8165 ?\u945 \'e1\u968 \'f8\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  Stephanos Byzantios, Metrischer Titel (Anthologia Graeca IX, 385; von Hand IA): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u8150 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u928 \'d0\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u8051 ?\u966 \'f6\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7936 ?\u961 \'f1\u8053 ?\u970 \'fa\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7965 ?\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u7984 ?\u967 \'f7\u956 \'ec\u8053 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx345\tx675\qj\ri0\sb150\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (ff. 249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \endash 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\cf1 inc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 (V. 1) >\u8043 ?<\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u7985 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8050 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u971 \'fb\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u955 \'eb\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u956 \'ec\u940 \'dc\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20\cf1 des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  (V. 867) \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8019 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u928 \'d0\u951 \'e7\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20\cf1 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  \u793