\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx225\tx450\qj\ri0\sb120\sa60\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (ff. 249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \endash 267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Scholien aus b (E\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ?) und Glossen erster Hand, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bachmann 1835 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , S. 618\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 664, Dindorf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1877 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), III, S. 71\endash 105 (ohne \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 *\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Scholia); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Erbse 1975 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  IV, S. 155\endash 312 (b mit einigen Bindefehlern zu E\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): (f.\~249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Erbse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1a. \emdash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Erbse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1b, 3b, 3a, 4a, 7\endash 10, 7. \emdash  (f.\~249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) 8a, 8c, 9a, 10b. \emdash  ... \emdash  (f. 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 17\endash 21) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bachmann \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 zu V. 564 (Eustathius, III, S. 899, jedoch abweichend). \emdash  (f. 262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Z. 2\endash 6) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bachmann \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 zu V. 633 (vgl. Eustathius, III, S. 908\endash 909): (Z. 2\endash 6) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8013 ?\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f