lain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u8048 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u968 \'f8\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \emdash  (Z. 17\endash 20) Vgl. Etymologicum Gudianum \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8165 ?\u8051 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 \ldblquote : \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u8172 ?\u8051 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u7985 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u8050 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7940 ?\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ... \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u7972 ?\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \emdash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  (Z. 20\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 25) Erbse 857\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 857b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (BE\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \emdash  (Z. 26\endash 31) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bachmann \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 zu V. 860, 865, 867 (Eustathius, Comment. III, S. 943).}

